# Sunbird Standard // Sunbird Effigy. "Craft with one or more {5}" (CR 702.167a) takes any other permanents Bot1 controls
# and cards from its graveyard: here three - Llanowar Elves (green), the Lightning Bolt card in the graveyard (red) and a
# colorless Mox Ruby. Sunbird Effigy's power and toughness are the number of colors among the exiled cards used to craft
# it (CR 702.167c, 604.3): 2/2, with flying, vigilance and haste, so it attacks the turn it is crafted. Its "{T}: For each
# color among the exiled cards used to craft this creature, add one mana of that color" adds {R} and {G}. The Standard's
# own "{T}: Add one mana of any color" pays for it.

